e randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nXuanxuan, Zhiming, and Weijie are classmates in college. That day, they go to a party together. Zhiming jokes that his dance skills are sure to beat Weijie. Then, Zhiming notices Xuanxuan standing alone in the corner, not dancing. He walks over quickly, calls out in a special voice, \"Weijie, watch me dance the steps you teach me yesterday.\" Then Zhiming starts to dance. Zhiming dances very happily, but he keeps glancing at Xuanxuan's reaction.\n\n[Question]\nWhat does Zhiming want to do?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Walks away and continues to dance with other friends.\nB. Walks to Weijie and shows off his dance skills are better than Weijie.\nC. Walks to Xuanxuan and shows off his dance skills to her.\nD. Walks to Xuanxuan and dances, inviting Xuanxuan to start dancing together.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.01798540521695209,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e0ccd6006945d27fd30d","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367692442,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:28:12","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"c70a8f85e80f464fbb63fa0e015af2ff"}